    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Episode 3: A gray world</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/environment/2026-01-29/episode-3-a-gray-world</link>
      <description>Former workers at Saint-Gobain’s New Hampshire plant share what they did — and didn’t — know about PFOA and its potential health effects. And how the chemical industry has worked to sow doubt to its own benefit.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nhpr.org/environment/2026-01-29/episode-3-a-gray-world</guid>
