    <item>
      <title>Episode 4: The neighborly thing to do</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/2026-01-29/episode-4-the-neighborly-thing-to-do</link>
      <description>When we’ve been exposed to something that could harm us, what are we supposed to do — as regulators, as doctors, as company executives, or as people just trying to live our lives?</description>
